        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.251,
            0.302,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.284,
            0.432,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(一) HeLa×SL2 异质核"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.318,
            0.246,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 细胞培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.339,
            0.912,
            0.379
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）把细胞培养于加入了非必需氨基酸和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " FBS的MEM培养基中，并置于"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\% \\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的培养箱中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.383,
            0.914,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）在加入了 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "12\\% \\mathrm{FBS}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\mathrm{mmol / L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 谷氨酰胺的施耐德（Schneider）培养基中培育D.melanogaster SL2细胞，并置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "25^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 没有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的培养箱中（可以使用实验室中干净的抽屉）。这是一种悬浮生长的细胞系，它们可以在没有血清的情况下黏附在盖玻片上。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.448,
            0.913,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）异核体培养基:"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{HeLa} \\times \\mathrm{SL2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 异核体应该加入非必需氨基酸和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "12\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " FBS 的 MEM 培养基中，置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\% \\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的培养箱中培养。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.491,
            0.247,
            0.509
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.513,
            0.914,
            0.574
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）蛋白质合成抑制剂:50%乙醇稀释的10mg/ml溶液，储备在-20℃中。最后浓度应依照不同的细胞系决定。环己米特、茴香霉素最广泛使用的浓度范围是20～100μg/ml，依米丁的浓度是0.5～20μg/ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.577,
            0.914,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 磷酸盐溶液缓冲的含盐 PBS: 137mmol/L NaCl, 2.68mmol/L KCl, 8.06mmol/L "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Na}_{2}\\mathrm{HPO}_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 1.47mmol/L "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{KH}_{2}\\mathrm{PO}_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 即 1L 溶液需要称 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8\\mathrm{gNaCl}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、0.2g KCl、1.14g "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Na}_{2}\\mathrm{HPO}_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.2\\mathrm{g}\\mathrm{KH}_{2}\\mathrm{PO}_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 高压灭菌。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.643,
            0.247,
            0.66
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 实验步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.664,
            0.882,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 所有步骤都应该在超净工作台中进行，并且要使用灭菌的培养材料和试剂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.687,
            0.912,
            0.726
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) HeLa 细胞应培养至铺满 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mathrm{mm} \\times 10\\mathrm{mm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的盖玻片的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "75\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 左右，每个 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "35\\mathrm{mm} \\times 10\\mathrm{mm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的培养皿可容纳 4 个这样大小的盖玻片。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.73,
            0.912,
            0.769
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）用不含血清的 HeLa 培养基悬浮培养指数生长期的 D. melanogaster SL2 细胞，使浓度为  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 \\times 10^{7} \\sim 4 \\times 10^{7}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  细胞/ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.773,
            0.911,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）去掉 HeLa 细胞培养基，把其中  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的 SL2 悬浮液盖上盖玻片。在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\% CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  培养箱中培养 20min，让 SL2 细胞贴壁。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.817,
            0.916,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 更换培养基, 加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1.5 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 异核体培养基, 并且加入蛋白质合成抑制剂。把细胞置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C} 、 5 \\% \\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱至少 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 \\mathrm{~h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 以抑制蛋白质的合成。另外做一个对照试验, 用相同体积的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 乙醇代替蛋白质合成抑制剂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.881,
            0.917,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 融合步骤，在无菌培养皿中的每一个盖玻片上加 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 预热至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的PEG"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 7,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.417,
            0.055,
            0.583,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第五章 细胞生理"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.836,
            0.057,
            0.86,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "69"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.091,
            0.167,
            0.107
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1500。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.112,
            0.854,
            0.13
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 从培养箱中去除 HeLa/SL2 共培养基，并且用预热至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的 PBS 洗 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.134,
            0.892,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 用灭菌的镊子移开盖玻片, 在 PEG 滴剂中倒置 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (细胞面朝下)。然后,把盖玻片 (细胞面朝上) 放置在新的 P35 培养皿上, 用预热至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的 PBS 漂洗 2 次。用加入了蛋白质合成抑制剂的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1.5 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 预热的异核体培养基代替 PBS, 在进行穿梭的时候把异核体放入培养箱中 (通常 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 \\mathrm{~h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 或者更久)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.219,
            0.893,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 根据 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{~h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 间隔的时间进程, 用通常的方法固定并染色细胞。阳性和阴性对照试验应该使用单克隆抗体直接抗人类 hnRNPA 1 (一种穿梭于细胞核和细胞质的蛋白质) 和人类 hnRNPC (一种不穿梭的蛋白质), 见图 5-2。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.291,
            0.404,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.144,
                0.291,
                0.404,
                0.423
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_image_6.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.407,
            0.292,
            0.661,
            0.426
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.407,
                0.292,
                0.661,
                0.426
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.666,
            0.292,
            0.854,
            0.422
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.666,
                0.292,
                0.854,
                0.422
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.337,
                0.435,
                0.666,
                0.45
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图5-2 HeLa×SL2异核体（Celis，2006）"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.455,
            0.87,
            0.543
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "直接抗人类蛋白质的单克隆抗体通常都不能和存在于果蝇中的同源物反应。在这种情况中，外源人类蛋白质的穿梭可以在 HeLa×SL2 异核体中得到分析。A. HeLa×SL2 异核体的阶段对照图，箭头标志了来自于 HeLa 细胞质融合的细胞的小 SL2 细胞核；B. 在 A 中显示的异核体被人类非穿梭蛋白质 hnRNPC 的专一性单克隆抗体免疫染色，显示出异核体在蛋白质合成抑制剂（20μg/ml 依米丁）存在的情况下，被限制在 HeLa 细胞核内，箭头指出了 SL2 细胞核的位置；C. 用对人类 U2AF"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "^{65}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "专一的单克隆抗体对 HeLa×SL2 异核体"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.544,
            0.842,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "进行免疫染色，显示出在 SL2 细胞核（箭头处）内的人类蛋白质，表明这个蛋白质具有穿梭的能力"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.584,
            0.415,
            0.603
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{HeLa} \\times 3\\mathrm{T}3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 异核体"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.618,
            0.227,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 细胞培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.64,
            0.895,
            0.701
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 持续培养 HeLa 细胞于加入非必需氨基酸和 10% FBS 的 MEM 培养基中, 置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C} 、 5 \\% \\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱中。在进行异核体穿梭法和转染前 2 天, 应该把细胞分装到无菌的培养皿中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.705,
            0.888,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2)在加有10%FBS的D-MEM培养基中培养老鼠3T3细胞，培养箱设置37℃、5%CO₂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.749,
            0.834,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 异核体培养基:HeLa×3T3 异核体细胞的培养方法和 3T3 细胞的相同。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.77,
            0.227,
            0.787
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.793,
            0.895,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) PBS: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
